WEBVTT

00:00:14.984 --> 00:00:18.943
Good morning, Sugar. We'll go together
when I get home from school.

00:00:19.122 --> 00:00:22.990
I can't wait, so I'll
go to school with you.

00:00:23.226 --> 00:00:26.957
I want to perform with
you soon. That's ok, right?

00:00:27.697 --> 00:00:28.698
Oh, fine.

00:00:28.698 --> 00:00:31.801
Your mommy's song
is very beautiful.

00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:35.705
I want to play it over
and over, don't you?

00:00:35.705 --> 00:00:37.332
Yeah, me, too.

00:00:37.974 --> 00:00:39.669
-See you later!
-See you later!

00:00:42.311 --> 00:00:43.579
Hurry, hurry, Sugar!

00:00:43.579 --> 00:00:45.046
Wait! Wait!

00:01:12.575 --> 00:01:16.375
Hey, Saga, where's the piano?
Where did the piano go?

00:01:16.679 --> 00:01:18.704
Wh-What?

00:01:22.418 --> 00:01:25.922
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:25.922 --> 00:01:28.891
Kuchibiru ni

00:01:28.891 --> 00:01:33.419
Namida no rouge...

00:01:53.616 --> 00:01:57.186
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:57.186 --> 00:02:04.592
Ai nante, shiritaku naiwa.

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:11.667
Sugar Baby Love

00:02:11.667 --> 00:02:14.704
Kuchibiru ni

00:02:14.704 --> 00:02:18.140
Namida no rouge...

00:02:22.445 --> 00:02:26.215
Mokuyo ni

00:02:26.215 --> 00:02:29.151
Bara o kai,

00:02:29.151 --> 00:02:33.349
Tegami o soete.

00:02:36.859 --> 00:02:40.696
Sugar Baby Love

00:02:40.696 --> 00:02:43.466
Yume de au.

00:02:43.466 --> 00:02:47.459
Anata wa yasashii...

00:02:59.782 --> 00:03:03.218
Oh, my. Your
Magic Flowers are that big?

00:03:03.553 --> 00:03:07.557
Yeah, they're so big.
They're gonna bloom any day now.

00:03:07.557 --> 00:03:12.824
Oh, really? Actually, my Magic Flower's
buds are coming along nicely, too.

00:03:13.396 --> 00:03:16.661
I hope they bloom easily.

00:03:17.667 --> 00:03:18.656
Yeah.

00:03:18.801 --> 00:03:22.305
Then I'll be a
full-fledged Wind Fairy.

00:03:22.305 --> 00:03:24.535
Oh, my, it's embarrassing.

00:03:25.007 --> 00:03:26.998
Full-fledged, huh...

00:03:27.977 --> 00:03:29.968
What should I do?

00:03:32.081 --> 00:03:34.743
What should I do?

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:40.690
Saga's... Saga's
piano has disappeared!

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:41.679
-Huh?
-Huh?

00:03:43.359 --> 00:03:44.587
Why? Why?

00:03:45.061 --> 00:03:47.427
Why? Where did it go?

00:03:54.236 --> 00:03:57.694
What should I do?
Your mommy's piano is gone.

00:03:58.474 --> 00:03:59.675
-There's nothing we can do.

00:03:59.675 --> 00:04:00.664
-There's nothing we can do.
-Huh?

00:04:02.311 --> 00:04:04.714
That piano was for sale.

00:04:04.714 --> 00:04:07.877
I just pestered him
to let me play it.

00:04:08.484 --> 00:04:09.986
-There's nothing I can do.

00:04:09.986 --> 00:04:11.146
-There's nothing I can do.
-Saga.

00:04:13.322 --> 00:04:17.460
Sorry, Sugar.
I promised you we'd perform together.

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:20.020
No! You haven't
broken your promise!

00:04:20.663 --> 00:04:23.860
Leave it to me, Saga!
I'll find your piano for you!

00:04:24.667 --> 00:04:26.396
H-Hey, Sugar!

00:04:30.973 --> 00:04:36.172
Saga's really sad.
She loved that piano so much.

00:04:37.446 --> 00:04:40.182
If it was me,
I know I'd be crying.

00:04:40.182 --> 00:04:43.674
But, but Saga...

00:04:44.787 --> 00:04:47.950
That doesn't mean you
have to cry for her, Sugar.

00:04:48.124 --> 00:04:49.113
What?

00:04:49.258 --> 00:04:50.960
So where should
we start searching?

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:54.327
Well, let's investigate
the music store first.

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:56.699
I like that piano, too.

00:04:56.699 --> 00:04:59.463
If we all search,
I'm sure we'll find it.

00:04:59.702 --> 00:05:02.796
Pepper, thanks! Salt!

00:05:02.972 --> 00:05:06.601
Q-Quit it, Sugar! Quit it!

00:05:12.648 --> 00:05:15.014
That piano really is gone.

00:05:16.285 --> 00:05:20.278
It's like there's just a big
hole there. It seems so lonely.

00:05:21.657 --> 00:05:23.852
Hey, Mister,
you know, don't you?

00:05:23.959 --> 00:05:27.656
Where did Saga's
piano go? I said...

00:05:28.497 --> 00:05:29.987
Hey, Mister!

00:05:43.446 --> 00:05:44.913
Is that so?

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:59.284
Where did it go?
I want to see Saga's face light up.

00:06:06.102 --> 00:06:10.973
This isn't it. I wonder if it's
gone somewhere far away.

00:06:10.973 --> 00:06:12.641
I've gotta find it!

00:06:12.641 --> 00:06:15.906
Saga and I are going to
perform her mommy's song!

00:06:19.348 --> 00:06:23.444
I hope this doesn't turn into
something heart-breaking, Sugar.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:26.981
-What? That piano?
-What? That piano?

00:06:27.256 --> 00:06:28.655
Yeah, it's true.

00:06:28.958 --> 00:06:33.662
"Yeah, it's true"? That piano
was special to you, wasn't it?

00:06:33.662 --> 00:06:35.664
Was it really sold?

00:06:35.664 --> 00:06:37.433
What will you do, Saga?

00:06:37.433 --> 00:06:40.002
What? I'm not going
to do anything.

00:06:40.002 --> 00:06:44.029
Anyway, what would be good for
Greta's birthday present?

00:06:44.507 --> 00:06:49.678
Saga doesn't seem any different.
It's kind of throwing me off balance.

00:06:49.678 --> 00:06:52.381
Yeah, but if that's
what she says...

00:06:52.381 --> 00:06:55.282
Oh, how about this?
What do you think?

00:06:55.985 --> 00:06:57.520
-It's cute.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:58.687
-It's cute.
-Isn't it?

00:06:58.687 --> 00:07:02.691
It's a waste to give it
to Greta. I'll buy it instead.

00:07:02.691 --> 00:07:05.694
Excuse me.
Do you have one more of these?

00:07:05.694 --> 00:07:07.093
Me, too.

00:07:16.372 --> 00:07:17.703
What is it, Saga?

00:07:18.707 --> 00:07:22.077
Oh, nothing. That one's
cute, too. Let me see.

00:07:22.077 --> 00:07:26.343
No, this pendant is my reward
for all my persistence.

00:07:26.582 --> 00:07:28.551
What persistence?

00:07:28.551 --> 00:07:29.711
All of it.

00:07:30.019 --> 00:07:32.721
Nothing good ever comes of
your persistence, Norma.

00:07:32.721 --> 00:07:34.188
Excuse me?

00:07:45.167 --> 00:07:47.192
This is the funny part.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:51.740
Phil had brought this huge balloon
to his secret hide-out

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:54.038
for an experiment, he said.

00:07:54.310 --> 00:07:57.913
Anyway, Joe the
Crow flew in and...

00:07:57.913 --> 00:07:59.278
-Bang!
-Oh!

00:07:59.515 --> 00:08:01.250
I was so surprised.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:05.287
But I think Joe was
the most surprised of all.

00:08:05.287 --> 00:08:07.278
His eyes were so wide.

00:08:07.423 --> 00:08:11.154
Oh, Saga, I had a
phone call from Paul today...

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:12.156
Oh, yeah!

00:08:12.695 --> 00:08:15.297
I bought Greta's
birthday present.

00:08:15.297 --> 00:08:18.698
It's so cute.
I'll show you, Grandma.

00:08:26.709 --> 00:08:29.701
I've just gotta
forget about it.

00:08:34.383 --> 00:08:35.372
Sugar?

00:08:35.718 --> 00:08:38.209
Oh. I'm home, Saga.

00:08:40.289 --> 00:08:43.224
Oh, look at you.
Are you sure you're ok?

00:08:43.525 --> 00:08:47.296
I'm fine. I'm fine.
Just wait a little longer, ok?

00:08:47.296 --> 00:08:50.231
I promise I'll find
your piano for you.

00:08:53.569 --> 00:08:54.729
Sugar.

00:08:55.838 --> 00:08:56.998
Saga...

00:09:17.693 --> 00:09:19.684
-Happy Birthday!
-Happy Birthday!

00:09:19.795 --> 00:09:21.563
My, everyone...

00:09:21.563 --> 00:09:23.699
-Congratulations!
-Congratulations!

00:09:23.699 --> 00:09:24.688
Thank you.

00:09:29.705 --> 00:09:31.468
Thank you, everyone.

00:09:31.607 --> 00:09:33.598
Greta, congratulations!

00:09:35.945 --> 00:09:39.448
I don't have the words
to thank you for coming

00:09:39.448 --> 00:09:44.044
to my great and gorgeous
birthday party today.

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:48.557
Then just skip the introduction
and get straight to the food.

00:09:48.557 --> 00:09:49.251
Hey.

00:09:49.558 --> 00:09:53.929
Enjoy your time here
today, everyone. Right, Dear?

00:09:53.929 --> 00:09:57.967
Yes. I can't believe Greta,

00:09:57.967 --> 00:10:01.470
who's changed schools so
many times in the past,

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:05.941
has made so many friends.
Thank you all for loving Greta!

00:10:05.941 --> 00:10:07.272
Oh, Father.

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:11.135
I should have
brought Sugar.

00:10:20.689 --> 00:10:22.179
Stop it!

00:10:22.691 --> 00:10:27.719
I won't take your treasure.
I'm just looking for the piano!

00:10:29.365 --> 00:10:30.696
Good grief!

00:10:33.002 --> 00:10:33.991
Sugar!

00:10:36.271 --> 00:10:37.706
We did it, Sugar!

00:10:37.706 --> 00:10:39.435
We finally found it.

00:10:39.708 --> 00:10:40.606
What?

00:10:40.943 --> 00:10:42.433
This is from us.

00:10:42.711 --> 00:10:47.016
Oh, Miss Saga, thank you.
As number one in our class,

00:10:47.016 --> 00:10:50.713
there's no gift that won't
suit me. It's almost frightening.

00:10:52.721 --> 00:10:58.127
That's from us. Its name is
Pet Robot Ribbit Ribbit Ace.

00:10:58.127 --> 00:11:00.118
It's all slimy.
Isn't it cute?

00:11:02.264 --> 00:11:03.731
I-Is it cute?

00:11:05.634 --> 00:11:06.726
Father!

00:11:07.069 --> 00:11:08.593
What? Really?

00:11:09.038 --> 00:11:11.063
You saw a white piano, Miss Kitty?

00:11:13.175 --> 00:11:17.880
It seems she just saw a piano
delivered to a house in this area.

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:20.115
Where? Where? Which house?

00:11:20.115 --> 00:11:21.383
All right...

00:11:21.383 --> 00:11:24.553
Shall I show you
my present now?

00:11:24.553 --> 00:11:27.689
Oh, your present!
What could it be?

00:11:27.689 --> 00:11:29.391
Come on, everyone.
This way.

00:11:29.391 --> 00:11:34.693
It seems the piano is a birthday
present for the girl who lives there...

00:11:36.331 --> 00:11:38.026
Birthday present?

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:40.269
-What is it?

00:11:40.269 --> 00:11:41.293
-What is it?
-No way!

00:12:06.962 --> 00:12:08.759
Why?

00:12:22.678 --> 00:12:23.679
Mother...

00:12:23.679 --> 00:12:25.670
Thank you, Father!

00:12:25.914 --> 00:12:30.819
Well, you've been saying you
wanted a piano. I searched everywhere,

00:12:30.819 --> 00:12:33.522
but I couldn't
find a good one.

00:12:33.522 --> 00:12:36.291
When I glanced into
the music shop in town,

00:12:36.291 --> 00:12:40.662
I was so surprised. Oh, Heavens!
This is perfect for Greta!

00:12:40.662 --> 00:12:44.566
A piano made for Greta.
That's what I thought.

00:12:44.566 --> 00:12:47.536
It's quite a nice piano,
don't you think?

00:12:47.536 --> 00:12:51.707
Yes, very nice.
I've fallen in love with it already.

00:12:51.707 --> 00:12:54.076
A piano for a
birthday present?

00:12:54.076 --> 00:12:56.145
But it's not
unexpected for Greta.

00:12:56.145 --> 00:13:00.449
What do you mean?
Ribbit Ribbit Ace is much cooler!

00:13:00.449 --> 00:13:01.717
Right, Saga?

00:13:01.717 --> 00:13:03.708
Huh? Y-Yeah.

00:13:05.721 --> 00:13:12.650
It's wonderful. I can't believe this piano
is mine! It's the best birthday ever.

00:13:13.462 --> 00:13:17.065
Oh, Miss Saga.
Do you like this piano that much?

00:13:17.065 --> 00:13:18.657
Ah, um...

00:13:20.669 --> 00:13:24.969
You can come and play anytime
you like, Miss Saga.

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:31.345
After all, it's the piano my father
gave me as a present. But first...

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:35.211
Let's see who's the best
pianist in the class! A contest!

00:13:37.686 --> 00:13:42.020
I'll let you hear my
beautiful performance first.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:52.999
NOOO!

00:13:55.137 --> 00:13:58.440
I, um. I'm sorry!

00:13:58.440 --> 00:13:59.429
-Saga!
-Saga!

00:13:59.908 --> 00:14:01.743
What on earth is going on?

00:14:01.743 --> 00:14:04.279
I've never known her to
back down from a challenge.

00:14:04.279 --> 00:14:06.577
I guess I misjudged you, Saga!

00:14:07.115 --> 00:14:08.104
No...

00:14:10.552 --> 00:14:12.543
That's not it, Greta.

00:14:19.328 --> 00:14:21.523
Oh, I wonder if
that's the house.

00:14:22.331 --> 00:14:24.128
Thanks, Miss Kitty.

00:14:25.534 --> 00:14:26.735
-Let's split up and look for it.

00:14:26.735 --> 00:14:27.326
-Let's split up and look for it.
-Right!

00:14:42.284 --> 00:14:44.582
It's not here.

00:14:45.387 --> 00:14:47.617
I wonder where
Saga's piano is.

00:14:51.193 --> 00:14:54.185
Hello.
Is Saga's piano he...

00:14:56.198 --> 00:14:58.689
It's here!
Saga's piano...

00:15:03.705 --> 00:15:04.694
Greta?

00:15:06.074 --> 00:15:08.577
What trick of fate is this?

00:15:08.577 --> 00:15:13.446
That Saga's piano would
be delivered to my house?

00:15:14.816 --> 00:15:18.343
Ooh! It's not my fault!

00:15:22.658 --> 00:15:24.649
Wh-What have I done?

00:15:27.763 --> 00:15:31.233
I heard a noise from in here...
Oh! The piano!

00:15:31.233 --> 00:15:34.669
What, Greta!
Hey, Sugar, what's going on?

00:15:35.671 --> 00:15:37.539
This is Greta's house.

00:15:37.539 --> 00:15:38.528
-Huh?
-Huh?

00:15:40.375 --> 00:15:43.674
It's not my fault.

00:15:46.181 --> 00:15:49.173
After all, today is my birthday.

00:15:58.527 --> 00:15:59.858
Oh, Saga!

00:16:00.696 --> 00:16:05.633
Will you buy one? Today's apples
are very fresh. Hey, Saga?

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:09.628
Oh, sorry.

00:16:11.073 --> 00:16:12.074
Mr. Luchino?

00:16:12.074 --> 00:16:13.974
Oh, it's you, Saga.
What's the matter?

00:16:14.376 --> 00:16:15.644
What about you,
Mr. Luchino?

00:16:15.644 --> 00:16:17.879
Have you left the store
to go shopping again?

00:16:17.879 --> 00:16:21.650
It's like they say: You can't be
healthy on an empty stomach.

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.117
Do they say that?

00:16:23.352 --> 00:16:24.649
Here, Saga.

00:16:26.388 --> 00:16:27.650
Cheer up.

00:16:28.657 --> 00:16:29.783
Mr. Luchino.

00:16:30.292 --> 00:16:33.853
Well, you know...
Life has its ups and downs.

00:16:35.263 --> 00:16:40.496
But, well, moping around won't
help anything. Right, Saga?

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:42.659
Saga.

00:17:06.161 --> 00:17:11.463
It's always... so sudden.
Things suddenly disappear.

00:17:25.147 --> 00:17:27.138
Oh, I messed up!

00:17:28.784 --> 00:17:29.648
Coming!

00:17:31.987 --> 00:17:34.956
Are you Ingrid Bergman's daughter?

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:38.723
Yes, I am, but...
What is it?

00:17:45.734 --> 00:17:47.224
Mommy...

00:18:24.806 --> 00:18:27.707
I thought you wouldn't
come anymore.

00:18:29.711 --> 00:18:33.515
I always messed up
my mother's song.

00:18:33.515 --> 00:18:37.542
She'd always show me
where I made a mistake.

00:18:38.186 --> 00:18:41.189
And say,
"This is how you play it."

00:18:41.189 --> 00:18:43.157
Always. Always...

00:18:44.559 --> 00:18:49.553
When I played the piano, my mother
was by my side. That's how I felt.

00:18:49.898 --> 00:18:50.887
Saga.

00:18:51.199 --> 00:18:54.936
That's why...
I pestered you

00:18:54.936 --> 00:18:59.202
to let me play
the piano, but, but...

00:18:59.741 --> 00:19:00.842
-I'm sorry, Saga.

00:19:00.842 --> 00:19:01.171
-I'm sorry, Saga.
-Why?

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:03.944
Why did you
have to sell it?

00:19:04.513 --> 00:19:05.207
Saga!

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:16.679
Cheer up, ok?

00:19:19.227 --> 00:19:21.457
Saga, I'm sorry.

00:19:25.233 --> 00:19:29.397
After all, it's the piano my father
gave me as a present.

00:20:09.678 --> 00:20:11.009
Mommy...

00:20:12.681 --> 00:20:13.909
Saga!

00:20:14.683 --> 00:20:16.583
There you are! Saga!

00:20:16.952 --> 00:20:17.941
Sugar.

00:20:19.688 --> 00:20:24.693
Saga! What are you doing here?
Did you fall?

00:20:24.693 --> 00:20:27.526
No. It's nothing. I'm fine.

00:20:27.696 --> 00:20:30.256
Listen, Saga!
We found the piano!

00:20:32.067 --> 00:20:36.026
Where do you
think it was? Actually...

00:20:36.104 --> 00:20:39.374
Ta-dah!
It was at Greta's house!

00:20:39.374 --> 00:20:43.178
Greta was making a
strange face, though.

00:20:43.178 --> 00:20:47.716
But if you ask her, you can go
play it anytime you want, right?

00:20:47.716 --> 00:20:49.707
That's good,
isn't it, Saga?

00:20:50.719 --> 00:20:51.981
No, it's not...

00:20:57.025 --> 00:20:58.014
Saga?

00:20:59.728 --> 00:21:04.222
Oh, good. You were so late,
I was starting to get worried.

00:21:04.733 --> 00:21:07.725
Now come on.
Dinner will be ready soon.

00:21:08.603 --> 00:21:10.468
Sorry, Grandma.

00:21:10.805 --> 00:21:11.806
Saga?

00:21:11.806 --> 00:21:14.434
Sorry. I just...

00:21:17.078 --> 00:21:18.067
Saga!

00:21:21.783 --> 00:21:23.318
What is it, Saga?

00:21:23.318 --> 00:21:27.687
You said "sorry" to Grandma Regina.
Did you do something wrong?

00:21:28.957 --> 00:21:31.960
I've decided I'm going
to get the piano back.

00:21:31.960 --> 00:21:36.097
Huh? Oh, Saga.
Didn't you hear what I said?

00:21:36.097 --> 00:21:39.234
The piano's at Greta's,
so you can play it anytime...

00:21:39.234 --> 00:21:41.702
I don't want to
lose anything else!

00:21:48.476 --> 00:21:49.704
I don't...

00:21:54.716 --> 00:21:56.479
want to lose it...

00:21:56.718 --> 00:21:59.949
Saga, you look scary...

00:22:21.076 --> 00:22:25.580
Tsuki no negai

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:29.250
Mizu ni tokete

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:34.489
Shiroi namiki-michi mitsuketa

00:22:34.489 --> 00:22:39.294
Hoshi-kuzu no uta

00:22:39.294 --> 00:22:47.836
Nana-iro no hashi o wataru kaze

00:22:47.836 --> 00:22:53.041
Shitte ita yo ne

00:22:53.041 --> 00:22:57.979
Kimochi tsunagu ureshisa

00:22:57.979 --> 00:23:00.181
Sugar Snow

00:23:00.181 --> 00:23:08.223
Kona-yuki mau machi ni yagate

00:23:08.223 --> 00:23:13.528
Kirei na hana saku kisetsu ni

00:23:13.528 --> 00:23:19.901
Anata o omou

00:23:19.901 --> 00:23:24.372
Kokoro o tokasu

00:23:24.372 --> 00:23:28.676
Ai wa, yume wa

00:23:28.676 --> 00:23:35.206
Sono mune ni aruno

00:23:40.021 --> 00:23:40.922
Preview of Next Episode

00:23:40.922 --> 00:23:44.425
Preview of Next Episode
Saga's acting strange, even after
we finally found the piano.

00:23:44.425 --> 00:23:48.596
And Sugar seems
down, too. I'm worried.

00:23:48.596 --> 00:23:49.697
You're right...

00:23:49.697 --> 00:23:54.702
You seem out of sorts, as well, Salt.
Are you worried about something?

00:23:54.702 --> 00:23:56.371
You're right...

00:23:56.371 --> 00:23:58.202
Huh?
Did you say something?

00:23:58.573 --> 00:24:03.044
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The Next Episode Is
"The Lonely Two."

00:24:03.044 --> 00:24:06.639
It's finally time for us
to begin our journey!
